Bind Npc 31572 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31571 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 691 "Collecting Mana Pieces IV"
    Journal for karus "You must collect Mana pieces with [Senior Researcher] Gaaz."
    Journal for elmorad "You must collect Mana pieces with [Senior Researcher] Aldos."
    Collect 5 of 389560000

Requires player level >= 69 and quest 690 is completed

Rewards
    Give 10000000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Got a call from [Chief Researcher] Gaz. He says this going to be the last one. Let's go to Islant."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Got a call from [Chief Researcher] Ados. He says this going to be the last one. Let's go to Islant."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Ah, you are here. I'm going to ask you for the last request. The previous researches went smoothly so I suspect no need for further experiments. Now, there's only one last experiment left to go."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It will be pretty tough this time. It's the [Apostle of the Storm], a magical creature that uses storm magic. Please get the [Wild mana piece] which carries their energy.\n\n[Senior Researcher]Gaz from Eslant has requested to get some [Wild mana piece] from the [Apostle of the Storm]."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Ah, you are here. I'm going to ask you for the last request. The previous researches went smoothly so I suspect no need for further experiments. Now, there's only one last experiment left to go."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It will be pretty tough this time. It's the [Apostle of the Storm], a magical creature that uses storm magic. Please get the [Wild mana piece] which carries their energy.\n\n[Senior Researcher]Aldos from Eslant has requested to get some [Wild mana piece] from the [Apostle of the Storm]."

On in_progress
    Say "It's [Apostle of the Storm]. It's [Wild mana piece]!. Please don't do this to me."

On claimable
    Show quest "Nicely done. I can now do the final experiment.\n\nYou have done very well. You will be on top of my list if I need something else in the future, <selfname. Goodbye."
